WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.136
BILL WEIR, IS IN
PUNTA GORDA.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:07.207
BILL, YOU SPENT TIME WITH
ANOTHER GROUP OF RESCUERS,

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:11.644
VOLUNTEERS, THE CAJUN NAVY,
THEY GOT THAT NAME BECAUSE OF

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.279
THE RESPONSE TO KATRINA.
WHAT YOU SAW AND DID WITH THEM

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:19.018
IS JUST STUNNING.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, POPPY.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.154
ONE OF THE BEST TIPS I EVER GOT
FOR COVERING STORIES LIKE THIS

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.924
COMES FROM MR. ROGERS.
HE TAUGHT MY KIDS THAT, WHEN

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:28.027
YOU SEE THESE HORRIBLE SCARY
IMAGES, AND THESE EVENTS, LOOK

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:33.633
FOR THE HELPERS.
THE CAJUN NAVY HAS BEEN PART OF

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.935
THAT DESCRIPTOR, THEY HAVE BEEN
AMAZING HELPERS.

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.004
THERE'S OTHER GROUPS NOW THAT
HAVE STARTED SINCE THEN.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:41.541
YESTERDAY, THEY JOINED FORCES
AND I WENT ALONG FOR THE RIDE.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:50.583
&gt;&gt; AFTER UNIONS VIOLENT VISIT,
THIS IS WHAT IS LEFT OF THE

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.721
CAUSEWAY BRIDGE FOR MAINLAND
FLORIDA TO SANIBEL ISLAND.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:59.659
THIS IS THE NOW IMPASSIBLE
BRIDGE TO PINE ISLAND.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:05.498
FOR RESIDENTS OF BOTH, BOATS
AND HELICOPTERS ARE THE ONLY

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:08.601
EXIT OPTIONS.
AND WHILE COAST GUARD BLACK

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:13.272
HARKS AND CHINOOK BUZZED OVER
THE BARRIER ISLANDS, TWO OF THE

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:19.646
ONLY VOTES IN THIS PART OF THE
GOLF CARROT CIVILIAN VOLUNTEERS

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:22.515
FROM THE CAJUN NAVY.
THOSE GOOD OLD BOYS WITH BOATS

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:27.587
AND BIG HEARTS.
&gt;&gt; IF YOU TELL US THERE'S

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.756
SOMEONE WHO NEEDS TO BE PICKED
UP, WE WILL TRY AND GO GET

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:32.192
THEM.
&gt;&gt; A NEW INITIATIVE CALLED

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:40.200
PROJECT DYNAMO IS MORE
ACCUSTOMED TO SAVING AMERICANS

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.838
FROM WAR ZONES.
&gt;&gt; HURRICANE IAN QUALIFIES.

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:48.608
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE NAMED AFTER
CHURCHILL'S OPERATION.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:53.846
&gt;&gt; CORRECT.
&gt;&gt; TO GET PEOPLE OUT OF DUNKIRK

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:58.518
--
&gt;&gt; AND HERE WE ARE RESCUING

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:00.153
PEOPLE FROM SANIBEL.
WHICH IS ALSO CUT OFF.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.056
IT'S VERY APROPOS.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU NEED HELP?

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:05.725
&gt;&gt; YOU WANT TO GET ME OUT OF
HERE?

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:10.196
&gt;&gt; GIVE US A MINUTE, WE WILL
COME UP THERE.

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:16.769
&gt;&gt; WE FOLLOWED THE CRY FOR HELP
ASHORE ON SANIBEL TO FIND A

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.807
GENTLEMAN EAGER TO ACCEPT THE
BOAT LIFT, BUT UNABLE TO

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:22.342
CONVINCE HIS BETTER HALF.
&gt;&gt; COME ON.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:28.481
&gt;&gt; TO WHERE?
&gt;&gt; FORT MYERS.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:32.352
&gt;&gt; THE BRIDGE IS KNOCKED OUT.
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT READY TO GO.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:36.522
&gt;&gt; A CURSORY STROLL AROUND THIS
PART OF SANIBEL REVEALS PLENTY

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:40.393
OF HAZARDS, LIKE THE HITS OF
NATURAL GAS SPEWING FROM A

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:43.129
BROKEN TANK.
BUT IN ONE OF THE MOST COVETED

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:47.100
ZIP CODES IN FLORIDA, THE
CONSTRUCTION MOSTLY HELD UP,

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.670
WHICH IS IN STARK CONTRAST TO
PINE ISLAND.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:56.375
&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THIS ONE.
ABSOLUTELY FLATTENED.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:59.078
&gt;&gt; ESPECIALLY THE MOBILE HOMES
OF THE WORKING CLASS AND

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.847
RETIREES LIVING IN ST. JAMES
CITY.

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:03.516
&gt;&gt; HEY, MAN.
ARE YOU OKAY?

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:08.488
IT'S YOUR DAUGHTER CALLING US.
&gt;&gt; WHEN THEIR PHONE CUT OUT

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:15.094
EARLY IN THE STORM, THE
GRANDCHILDREN CALLED THE CAJUN

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:18.431
NAVY AND PROJECT DYNAMO AND
BEGGED THEM TO GO CHECK ON

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:21.401
THEM.
&gt;&gt; I HEARD THEY WERE NOT GOING

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:24.270
TO DO ANYTHING AFTER THE BRIDGE
CLOSED DOWN, BUT MY

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:29.309
GRANDDAUGHTERS ARE AN OHIO, AND
SHE WAS CRYING HYSTERICAL WHEN

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:33.346
I TALKED TO HER.
AMID THINKING I HAD GOTTEN

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:34.414
HURT.
I SIT, NO.

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:37.684
THERE'S JUST NO SERVICE.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE THING, THE

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:40.119
UNCERTAINTY BRINGS SO MUCH.
&gt;&gt; I KNEW THAT.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:44.057
THAT HAD ME MORE WORRIED THAN
WHAT WAS GOING ON AT THE TIME.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:47.193
BECAUSE I KNEW MY FAMILY WAS
WORRIED.

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:49.495
&gt;&gt; IT'S TERRIBLE WHAT WE ARE
GOING THROUGH.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.264
IT'S A TERRIBLE SET OF
CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:53.299
THE DESTRUCTION IS
UNBELIEVABLE.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:54.600
THE SUFFERING IS GOING TO BE
BAD.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.703
HUNDREDS OF PEOPLE ARE DEAD
RIGHT NOW, WE JUST HAVE NOT

00:03:56.703 --> 00:03:57.970
FOUND HIM YET.
SO THIS IS TRUE CARNAGE.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:05.411
IT'S A WAR ZONE.
&gt;&gt; THANK, YOU GENTLEMEN.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:08.614
&gt;&gt; BUT AT THE SAME TIME, I'M
VERY HAPPY WE CAN BE HERE TO

00:04:08.614 --> 00:04:13.252
HELP.
&gt;&gt; WHAT WAS ALSO INSPIRING WAS

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:16.122
PRIME AND THOSE GUYS HAD SO
MUCH EMPATHY FOR THE WOMAN WHO

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:18.091
DID NOT WANT TO LEAVE.
SHE WASN'T READY.

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:20.793
SHE MIGHT STILL BE IN SHOCK.
SHE DOESN'T REALIZE HOW

00:04:20.793 --> 00:04:25.031
UNTENABLE THE SITUATION IS ON
SANIBEL FOR MORE THAN A FEW

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:27.066
DAYS.
GIVE HER SPACE, MAYBE CHECK ON

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:30.136
HER THE NEXT DAY.
IT SPEAKS TO THE HUMAN ELEMENT

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:32.071
OF THIS STORY, THE PSYCHOLOGY
OF IT'LL.

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:35.808
AND ALSO, IN THESE DIVIDED
TIMES, IT IS SO REFRESHING THAT

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:39.045
THEY HAVE THE EAT THOSE OF A
FIRE DEPARTMENT HE SAYS.

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:41.080
YOU CALL 9-1-1, YOUR HOUSE IS
ON FIRE.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.015
THEY DON'T ASK YOU WHO YOU
VOTED FOR OR HOW THE FIRE

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:45.017
STARTED.
THEY JUST COME AND GET YOU.

00:04:45.017 --> 00:04:48.087
SO SO MANY FOLKS WHO EITHER
COULD NOT EVACUATE OR CHOSE NOT

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:51.124
TO, RIGHT NOW IS NOT THE TIME
TO SCOLD THEM.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:54.527
THEY ARE DEALING WITH IT AS
BEST THEY CAN AS WELL.

00:04:54.527 --> 00:05:00.099
POPPY, I'M TELLING YOU, THESE
MOMENTS BRING OUT THE BEST IF

00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:02.168
HUMAN NATURE SOMETIMES.
IT IS SO GREAT TO SEE.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:05.171
OF COURSE, THE WORST WE HAVE TO
WORRY ABOUT IS IN THE COMING

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:10.209
DAYS, BUT IF YOU GUYS ARE
INTERESTED, PROJECT DYNAMO DOT

00:05:10.209 --> 00:05:13.813
ORG OR CAJUN RESCUE DOT ORG, A
FEW BOOKS EVEN WILL HELP THEM

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:16.582
GUESS UP THEIR BOATS.
&gt;&gt; CAJUN NAVY IS ONE OF THE

00:05:16.582 --> 00:05:18.851
CONFIDENCE OF THE STORMS, GOING
ALL THE WAY BACK TO KATRINA.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:20.219
IT'S NICE TO SEE THEM OUT THERE
AGAIN.

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:21.387
THANK YOU SO MUCH, BILL.

